    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37337" root="كوب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَوْبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A sighing,</i> or <i>grief,</i> or <i>regret, for something that has past,</i> or <i>escaped one.</i> (K.) Probably formed from the mahmooz word [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَأْبَةٌ</span>].
(TA.) [Perhaps an inf. n.]

